X: 1
T: La cambo me fai mau
O: Traditional Provencal
N: A Provencal noel from Nicolas Saboly's collections (17th century), still
N: played on galoubet and tambourin. "My leg hurts" -- the shepherd's excuse.
N: Note values doubled from the 2/4 source so the moving value is a quarter.
N: Melody and score from mamalisa.com, transposed up a fifth.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/2=100
M: 4/4
K: Am
